,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉 りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13098","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c123343","characterName":"嵯王子 巡","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c123343"},"originalCharacterName":"嵯王子 巡","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meguru has a gentle face that could be mistaken for a girl, but in reality he is a boy. Possessing an angelic singing voice, he was seen as having a promising future as a countertenor singer, but after encountering Yasaka Fuuri at a hospital and being touched by her weakness, he began to wish to protect her. Fuuri also occasionally obeys Meguru when she is scolded by him. He has a timid and hesitant personality, but he can muster the courage to be strong for Fuuri's sake."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c123343"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c97c4bc5db3e53d7288501400e1bfeb536165e58d759c6cf17ad04a55b8d788.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffe0285bbb73d3bd65b165a984319e9a13bc313c39aa08330488a63e2d992e5f.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎津 まお","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13097","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c123349","characterName":