ed \"Arts-Knight Princess\". Her battle mode is, like her speech, blazing hot and full of confidence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a combination of Accany's review and Warum's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33fa72676c5ed9bf1378f0cb12959b6d425923c3e3d7222c484d3c1657ef4bad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/acf8540a0379ff61b8deb9ed9f9fb39e345473da5128e6f645e338fc7becfa19.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13095","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c431","characterName":"キザイア 緋乃神","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c431"},"originalCharacterName":"キザイア 緋乃神","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kizaia is Aisaku's senpai in school. Rumor has it she's a princess of a country. She is cold on the outside (especially towards Aisaku because she thinks he doesn't know anything about her, while still saying stuff as though he does), but in reality she seeks warmth from people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is wild, hot blooded and also one of the strongest Zelk-Riders, called \"Arts-Knight Princess\". Her battle mode is, like her speech, blazing hot and full of confidence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a combination of Accany's review and Warum's review"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the real Kizaia who put her clone in her place to lead the events from shadows."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c431"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a46daa14fdbd4e37f6c5dcd9aaf58b3d0d7e19b0356464481488c7cfac8d9aa9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21a56e8c0a7e4202a28e17952835eb1e63fad8aeb25ebf57792922d58d532f65.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c438","characterName":"姫荻 愛作","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c438"},"originalCharacterName":"姫荻 愛作","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's your really hotblooded, and really stupid protagonist. Really he's just… dumb. But his heart is at the right place and his brain does work a little better in emergencies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lives alone in his huge japanese style house (more like castle). His parents are always flying around."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He tends to act first and think later, and as mentioned, he isn't too bright but his passion is unbeatable. He likes to play darts but he sucks at it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a combination of Accany's review and Warum's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c438"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46e668d55554c5c237818ae9e7799480176c1a24b78a4fc58f67d8340f93f2ef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c782450c0414d9ffd66d76b6ce07b83d9c463253ee0f6e899dec71594502d4a.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古河 徹人","creatorId":"vndb:s299","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s299","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s299","name":"古河 徹人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13099","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c447","characterName":"恩田 芹果","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c447"},"originalCharacterName":"恩田 芹果","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aisaku's osananajimi. Her parents died when she was small and she was raised in an orphanage neighboring Aisaku's house. She is bright, gutsy, funny, and tomboyish but is pure as one can see from her prayers at the church. She has a huge bust, and the ability to have ridiculous fantasies that stun the people beside her. Lives together with her nii-san who works as the master of a cafe. It's pretty obvious throughout the story that she has feelings for him, but since our protagonist is very dumb, he doesn't notice it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a combination of Accany's review and Warum's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c447"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/175660346e00ca7c657af22157646ba80bd56903f9180e93a9997375ff32a33e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/